<div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="oneColumnArticleTheme"><div id="sectionHeadingForOneColumnArticle"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Why SIPROTEC 7SA87?</span></h2></div></div></div></div></div><div class="text-start container multitextblock "><div class="row justify-content-left"><div class="col col-md-8"><p>SIPROTEC 7SA87 is a modular distance protection device for high-voltage lines. It provides essential protection for electrical equipment by detecting and isolating faults with 1-pole or 3-pole tripping capabilities.</p><p>Electrical systems face challenges from short circuits and ground faults, leading to potential damage and downtime. SIPROTEC 7SA87 detects and selectively trips short circuits and ground faults across various network configurations to maintain system stability. Expect fast fault isolation with a minimum tripping time of 9 ms to minimize damage.</p><p>Secure your operations with cybersecurity features compliant with NERC CIP and BDEW Whitepaper requirements.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div id='4L4jP8F9fAj1QLMfe59N1K' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-tiles_2' data-ste-section-id='4L4jP8F9fAj1QLMfe59N1K'>
