<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Enhance safety" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Enhance safety</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Protect electrical equipment for selective 1- and 3-pole short circuit trips. Detect ground faults in power systems to safeguard personnel and assets and minimize downtime.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Operate easily" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Operate easily</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Handle devices and software confidently with a user-friendly design. Access information and diagnostic data quickly and securely via a web browser.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Achieve high availability" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Achieve high availability</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Maintain high availability in extreme conditions with conformal coating. Enable continuous operation and data integrity with strong redundancy protocols.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='6wV62ttnc5phQwy08CWF6I' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='6wV62ttnc5phQwy08CWF6I'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-6wV62ttnc5phQwy08CWF6I" class="CardsContainer" data-component-type="CardsContainer"><section id="6wV62ttnc5phQwy08CWF6I" class="cards-defaultBackground" role="region" aria-labelledby="section-heading-6wV62ttnc5phQwy08CWF6I"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Featured capabilities</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div class="row cards-container-row"><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Protection features" id="G_Protection%20features-0" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Protection%20features-0-title" aria-describedby="G_Protection%20features-0-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Protection%20features-0-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Protection features</h3><div id="G_Protection%20features-0-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Detect current-transformer saturation for fast tripping with high accuracy. Use the Fault Locator Plus for accurate fault location with inhomogenous line sections and targeted automatic overhead line section reclosing (AREC).</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="DIGSI 5 engineering tool" id="G_DIGSI%205%20engineering%20tool-1" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_DIGSI%205%20engineering%20tool-1-title" aria-describedby="G_DIGSI%205%20engineering%20tool-1-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_DIGSI%205%20engineering%20tool-1-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">DIGSI 5 engineering tool</h3><div id="G_DIGSI%205%20engineering%20tool-1-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Use DIGSI 5 to configure and combine protection, control, automation, monitoring and PQ functions. Adjust I/O flexibly in the SIPROTEC 5 modular system. Create automation functions with the graphical logic editor.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Communication protocols" id="G_Communication%20protocols-2" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Communication%20protocols-2-title" aria-describedby="G_Communication%20protocols-2-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Communication%20protocols-2-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Communication protocols</h3><div id="G_Communication%20protocols-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Integrate up to four pluggable communication modules for diverse, redundant protocols. Transmit data reliably via PRP and HSR.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459c4589ce8f899743c2f1031e839981f40d9/lib/helpers/esm/index.module.js"></script><disw-hydrate component="CardsContainer" props-url="/props/6wV62ttnc5phQwy08CWF6I-en-US.json" page-id="2ph2SCXL7Emt0cAV7MVnC6" container="comp-6wV62ttnc5phQwy08CWF6I"></disw-hydrate></template></div></is-land></div><div id='3gm1kAItFn4KEfieoa3huP' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-tile